    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market with RE/MAX Partners, Apartment 19, Block B2, Louisa Park is an attractive two-bedroom apartment offering bright, spacious accommodation in this highly convenient Leixlip location. A particular highlight of the property is its south-facing balcony, providing a wonderful outdoor extension to the living accommodation and an ideal spot to enjoy the sunshine.\r\nBright & Spacious Living\r\nInternally, the apartment offers a well-proportioned layout with an excellent balance of living and bedroom accommodation.\r\nAt the heart of the home is the generous open-plan living and dining area, a bright and welcoming space with direct access to the south-facing balcony. The favourable orientation allows the apartment to make the most of the natural light and creates an appealing outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining during the warmer months.\r\nJust off the living area is the kitchen, offering ample cabinetry, countertop workspace and everything required for comfortable everyday living.\r\nComfortable Accommodation\r\nThe apartment features two generously proportioned bedrooms, providing excellent flexibility for a range of buyers. The accommodation is completed by the main bathroom & an ensuite.\r\nWith its practical layout and comfortable living space, the apartment is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a well-located property in Leixlip.\r\nSuperb Leixlip Location\r\nLouisa Park enjoys an exceptionally convenient location on Station Road, with Louisa Bridge train station close by, making the property particularly attractive for commuters.\r\nLeixlip Village and its wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and everyday amenities are also within easy reach, while the location offers convenient access to the wider road network.\r\nAn Excellent Opportunity\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a highly convenient location and the added advantage of a south-facing balcony, Apartment 19 presents an excellent opportunity in this popular Leixlip development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c.1.30 x 5.68m\r\nLight fittings, storage, wooden floor, phone point.\r\n\r\nLIVING/DINING ROOM: c.3.97 x 4.88m\r\nLight fittings, wooden floor, Venetian blinds, wooden floor, door leading to balcony, TV/cable point.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN: c.2.69 x 2.47m\r\nLight fittings, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUTILITY/STORAGE ROOM: c.1.88 x 1.68m\r\nLight fitting, shelving units, area fully plumbed, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.3.08 x 3.46m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blinds, curtains, TV/cable point, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.2.27 x 1.09m\r\nLight fittings, extractor fan, fully tiled, WC, WHB, cubicle with mains shower.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: c.2.08 x 5.51m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobe, blind, wooden floor, door leading to balcony.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: c.2.76 x 1.92m\r\nLight fittings, extractor fan, fully tiled, WC, WHB, bath."
      },
